---
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
---

<footer class="site-footer" id="contact">
  <div class="shell footer-contact">
    <p class="footer-kicker">CONTACT / LET'S BUILD SOMETHING REAL</p>
    <h2>从一个具体问题开始。</h2>
    <p>如果你在做 AI、内容、社区或年轻用户相关的项目——欢迎联系我。</p>
    <ul class="footer-offers" aria-label="我目前愿意参与的方向">
      <li>AI 工作流与自动化探索</li>
      <li>内容策划和 X 运营</li>
      <li>社群工作台与信息系统</li>
      <li>用户反馈整理与需求验证</li>
      <li>AI 辅助网站和基础产品交付</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="footer-channels">
      <nav aria-label="联系安寻">
        <span class="footer-channel-label">联系我 / PERSONAL</span>
        <div class="footer-channel-icons">
          <SocialLinks networks={["telegram", "x", "github"]} />
        </div>
      </nav>
      <nav aria-label="联系 KOSX">
        <span class="footer-channel-label">联系 KOSX / ORGANIZATION</span>
        <div class="footer-channel-links">
          <a href={siteConfig.kosx.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">KOSX.ai ↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-channel-note">企业 AI 项目 · 社群与人才合作 · Builder 协作</p>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="shell footer-signature">
    <a class="footer-wordmark" href="/">A/ {siteConfig.name}</a>
    <p>Building in public since 18.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="shell footer-bottom">
    <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 安寻 Ansyn</span>
    <span>从高中系统脱机，接入真实世界。</span>
  </div>
</footer>
